moonlight-web-mimhid

This repository contains an unofficial add-on for Moonlight-Web. The add-on's
own files (overlay/, patches/, tools/, tests/) are released under the GNU
General Public License, version 3 or later, because they are combined with
Moonlight-Web and its patches are derived from its sources.

