  This repository does not contain its source. Builds are made from the
  official release tag; the copyright notice is kept in every file, and the
  three patches and the one appended CMake line only change a few lines of upstream files.

libmimhid
  Copyright (c) 2026 libmimhid contributors
  MIT License -- https://github.com/nemarpuc/libmimhid
  Fetched at build time, at its newest release (named in the release notes and in
